      "sourceTextSha256": "458d23cae3ac8db6799945cb5c90b7d47be996665d6a70434e6b72c50364f6d9",
      "text": "Transfer to the airport in Buenos Aires, flight to Iguazú. Check-in at the Gran Meliá Iguazú Hotel (Deluxe Room).\n\nExcursion to the Argentine side of the falls with an English-speaking guide. The Argentine side differs from the Brazilian one — here you'll walk directly above and below the falls, feeling the power of the falling water up close while enjoying the natural park surrounding this magnificent beauty. You'll witness the birth of the \"Devil's Throat.\" The network of man-made walkways and bridges is remarkable, allowing you to observe this natural phenomenon at very close range.",
